# Milestone: M3
# Covers: at(cond) watcher persists across multiple condition checks; the
#         watcher body fires when the condition transitions false->true.
#
# Activated: v0.10.7 W7 — at(cond) watcher shipped (M5 reactive runtime).
# Old label: M5
#
# The counter is read back as a value rather than echoed: `echo` is not a
# bare name in the single-session chk driver.

var x = 0; var fired = 0; at (x > 5) fired = fired + 1; var trigger = function() { x = 10 }; trigger(); fired
[00000000] 1
